  "caveats": [
    "Primary High with no displayed CVSS differs from Reviewed Critical and v4. Maintainer <=12.3.0 and fixed 13.0.0 remain distinct from the database <13.0.0 interval.",
    "Requires libjpeg-turbo >=3 with lossless JPEG support and a draft/thumbnail scaled decode. Full-scale load/resize and older JPEG decoders are explicitly unaffected; source describes a heap overwrite, not a confirmed real-world code execution incident.",
    "Fixed database source and developer advisory were individually compared. Database and maintainer dates remain separately attributed.",
    "Exploitation and CISA KEV are unverified; unknown is not evidence of absence.",
    "Public HTML was reviewed after an API rate-limit failure; exact maintainer modification/withdrawal timestamps were not exposed.",
    "2026-10-27 JSTにOSV APIと固定generationのPyPI全件エクスポートの正規化JSON一致を確認し、明示されたBitnami識別子を別名へ追補。元の公表・更新日時、影響範囲、開発元確認内容は保持し、今回すべての開発元本文を再確認したとは扱わない。",
    "2026-10-29のOSV全件エクスポートでPYSEC別名を確認。影響範囲・修正版・開発元の既存解釈は保持し、OSV原レコードの日時・列挙版・撤回は確認監査へ保存。"
